# Normalise line endings. Everything in this repo is authored LF; without this
# Git's Windows default rewrites checkouts to CRLF and the next contributor on a
# different platform sees every file as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets Git should never try to diff or convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb binary
*.mp3 binary

# Generated: collapse in diffs and exclude from language stats.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# Precomputed embedding: must never be line-ending normalised
*.bin binary
public/core/points.bin binary
